IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nsw-duties-core`
IMPORT `nsw-duties-seat`

-- Duties Act 1997 (NSW) -- cases for the buyer's seat (nsw-duties-seat.l4).
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a Revenue NSW ruling, calculator or decided case. The text is the Open Australian Legal Corpus version of
-- 2025-01-01, collected 10 March 2025, not the current official text.
--
-- Expected values were worked by hand from the deposited text, with the arithmetic in the comment above each line.
-- The positional calls are formatted by the scratchpad generator gen_nsw_duties_cases.py from a table.
--
-- THE YEAR'S AMOUNTS. For a contract signed from 1 July 2019 to 30 June 2020 the Act's own s 32 table applies and the
-- six amounts passed are ignored (passed as 0). For a later year the cases pass HYPOTHETICAL amounts H = 16000,
-- 34000, 91000, 341000, 1138000, 3414000: what s 33AC gives for A/B = 1.123 (asserted in nsw-duties-cases-core.l4).
-- They are not the amounts the Chief Commissioner published for any year. s 33AD base amounts for H: range 2 $200,
-- range 3 $470, range 4 $1,467 (from $1,467.50), range 5 $10,217 (from $10,217.50), range 6 $46,082 (from $46,082.50).

§ `Buying a home or land -- transfer duty`

-- s 21: the greater of the consideration and the unencumbered value.
#ASSERT `What is the dutiable value of my purchase` 700000 720000 EQUALS 720000
#ASSERT `What is the dutiable value of my purchase` 650000 600000 EQUALS 650000

-- 2019-20 table, range 5: $9,112 + $4.50 x 4,460 (446,000 / 100) = $29,182.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2020) 750000 740000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS `the duty is` 29182
-- Same, signed 30 June 2020, the last day of 2019-20; the amounts passed are ignored.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2020) 750000 740000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `the duty is` 29182
-- H, signed 1 March 2025: range 5, $10,217 + $4.50 x 4,090 = $28,622.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `the duty is` 28622
-- H, $800,000: $10,217 + $4.50 x 4,590 = $30,872.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2020) 800000 800000 `a strata lot occupied or suitable as a separate dwelling` FALSE FALSE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `the duty is` 30872
-- 2019-20, premium rate, residential: $152,502 + $7 x 4,600 = $184,702.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2020) 3500000 3500000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS `the duty is` 184702
-- 2019-20, a house and a shop is not s 32A residential land (s 32A(6)): $41,017 + $5.50 x 24,870 = $177,802.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2020) 3500000 3500000 `one house or one flat, and a shop` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS `the duty is` 177802
-- 2019-20, vacant residential land is s 32A residential land: $184,702.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2020) 3500000 3400000 `vacant land zoned for residential use` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS `the duty is` 184702
-- H, premium: premium base $46,082 + $5.50 x 22,760 = $171,262, + $7 x 5,860 = $212,282.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 4000000 4000000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `the duty is` 212282
-- H, other land is never at the premium rate: $46,082 + $5.50 x 28,620 = $203,492.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 4000000 4000000 `other land` TRUE TRUE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `the duty is` 203492
-- s 32B: residential, above the threshold, used for other purposes.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 4000000 4000000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `not covered` `s 32B applies: residential land above the premium threshold used for other purposes; its apportionment factor is not encoded`
-- s 32C: a parcel over 2 hectares above the threshold.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 4000000 4000000 `one house or one flat` FALSE TRUE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `not covered` `s 32C applies: a parcel of residential land of more than 2 hectares above the premium threshold; not encoded`
-- s 32C does not bite at or below the threshold: H, $3,414,000 is the premium base amount $171,262.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 3414000 3414000 `one house or one flat` FALSE TRUE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `the duty is` 171262
-- Before 1 July 2019 the deposit has no table.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2019) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 16000 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `not covered` `the liability arose before 1 July 2019, before the s 32 table in the deposit applied`
-- A later year with no amounts given (zeros).
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS `not covered` `the amounts given for the year cannot be amounts adjusted under s 33AC`
-- A later year with a range 2 threshold not a multiple of $1,000.
#ASSERT `What transfer duty do I pay on this home or land` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE 15500 34000 91000 341000 1138000 3414000 EQUALS `not covered` `the amounts given for the year cannot be amounts adjusted under s 33AC`

-- ss 15, 16, 16A, 17: within 3 months after liability arises (READING: the same day three months on, or the month's
-- last day where it is shorter).
#ASSERT `By what day must I lodge and pay the transfer duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 3 2025) EQUALS (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 6 2025)
#ASSERT `By what day must I lodge and pay the transfer duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2025) EQUALS (DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT `By what day must I lodge and pay the transfer duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2025) EQUALS (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2025)

-- s 33AC for one amount: A/B = 112.35 / 100 = 1.1235 -> 1.124 (a fourth decimal of 5 rounds up); $304,000 x 1.124 =
-- $341,696 -> $342,000. With the previous year's $345,000, s 33AC(4) keeps $345,000.
#ASSERT `What is the adjustable amount for the year` 304000 112.35 100 304000 EQUALS 342000
#ASSERT `What is the adjustable amount for the year` 304000 112.35 100 345000 EQUALS 345000

§ `First home buyers -- the First Home Buyers Assistance Scheme`

-- s 71(2): a first home owner has never owned residential property or had an approved application, and nor has a spouse.
#ASSERT `Am I a first home owner` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I a first home owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a first home owner` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a first home owner` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- With no spouse, the spouse answer is not read.
#ASSERT `Am I a first home owner` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE

-- Ava, 30, a citizen buying alone, $750,000 house: no duty (s 78A(1)(a): not more than $800,000).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Exactly $800,000: 'not more than', so no duty.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 800000 800000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- $800,001: eligible (under $1,000,000) but in the s 78A(2) band, whose formula is missing.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 800001 800001 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the s 78A(2) or (2A) concessional duty formula is missing from the deposited text`
-- $999,999: still in the band.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 999999 999999 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the s 78A(2) or (2A) concessional duty formula is missing from the deposited text`
-- $1,000,000: not less than the s 74(3)(a) cap.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 1000000 1000000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `the dutiable value is not less than the cap in s 74(3)`
-- Price $750,000 but worth $820,000: the dutiable value is $820,000 (s 21), in the band.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 820000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the s 78A(2) or (2A) concessional duty formula is missing from the deposited text`
-- Vacant block $350,000: no duty (s 78A(1)(b)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 350000 350000 `vacant land zoned for residential use` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Vacant block $400,000: in the s 78A(2A) band.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 400000 400000 `vacant land zoned for residential use` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the s 78A(2) or (2A) concessional duty formula is missing from the deposited text`
-- Vacant block $450,000: not less than the s 74(3)(b) cap.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 450000 450000 `vacant land zoned for residential use` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `the dutiable value is not less than the cap in s 74(3)`
-- A strata unit for $600,000: no duty.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 600000 600000 `a strata lot occupied or suitable as a separate dwelling` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Signed 30 June 2023: Schedule 1 cl 147(3) keeps the earlier Act, not deposited.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2023) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the agreement or transfer is before 1 July 2023, to which the Act as in force before the First Home Buyer Legislation Amendment Act 2023 applies (Schedule 1 cl 147(3)); not deposited`
-- Signed 1 July 2023: the deposited thresholds apply.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2023) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Signed 1 September 2020, in the s 78AA year: before 1 July 2023 too.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the agreement or transfer is before 1 July 2023, to which the Act as in force before the First Home Buyer Legislation Amendment Act 2023 applies (Schedule 1 cl 147(3)); not deposited`
-- Ava has owned a home before.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `a purchaser is not a first home owner, and the 5% allowance in s 71(7) does not apply`
-- Ava's spouse has owned a home before (s 71(2)(b)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `a purchaser is not a first home owner, and the 5% allowance in s 71(7) does not apply`
-- Ava has a spouse who has never owned one.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Ava is 17 (s 73(3)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 17 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `a purchaser is under 18 (s 73(3)), unless the Chief Commissioner determines otherwise under s 73(4)`
-- Ava is neither a citizen nor a permanent resident, buying alone (s 73(5)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `a purchaser is not an Australian citizen or permanent resident (s 73(5))`
-- Not a citizen, but buying 50/50 with a first home owner who is (s 73(6)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 31 TRUE 50 50 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Buying with a spouse, both first home owners, as joint tenants.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 30 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 32 TRUE 50 50 TRUE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- A co-buyer who has owned a home takes 5%: the s 71(7) allowance.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 60 TRUE 95 5 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- A co-buyer who has owned a home takes 10%: not eligible, but first home owners take 90%, so s 78B: formula missing.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 60 TRUE 90 10 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the s 78B(3) shared equity concession formula is missing from the deposited text`
-- A co-buyer who has owned a home takes 60%: first home owners take 40%, under s 78B(2)(a)'s 50%.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 60 TRUE 40 60 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `a purchaser is not a first home owner, and the 5% allowance in s 71(7) does not apply`
-- Joint tenants with a co-buyer who has owned a home: 50% each (s 14), so s 78B, formula missing.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 60 TRUE 50 50 TRUE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the s 78B(3) shared equity concession formula is missing from the deposited text`
-- Neither buyer a first home owner (spouses, Ava owned before).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE 30 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE 32 TRUE 50 50 TRUE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `a purchaser is not a first home owner, and the 5% allowance in s 71(7) does not apply`
-- Under an approved shared equity scheme, Ava 60% and the equity partner 40% (s 73A(2)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 60 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- A holiday home (s 75(2)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `the property is a holiday home (s 75(2))`
-- Business premises (s 75(1)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `the agreement involves a business or business premises (s 75(1))`
-- Not the whole property (s 74(2)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `the agreement is not for the whole of the property (s 74(2))`
-- No intention to live there (s 74(1), s 76).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not eligible under the scheme` `the agreement is not for a first home, or for a vacant block to be the site of one, to be lived in (s 74(1), s 76)`
-- No intention to live there, but in the Permanent Forces and enrolled (s 76(6)).
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `one house or one flat` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `no duty is chargeable under s 78A(1), once the Chief Commissioner approves the application`
-- Two or more dwellings.
#ASSERT `Is my purchase eligible under the scheme, and do I pay no duty` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) 750000 750000 `two or more dwellings` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE 100 0 FALSE EQUALS `not covered under the scheme` `the land has a building under construction or more than one dwelling, which the scheme's two cases (a private dwelling, a vacant block) do not plainly cover`
-- A building under construction.
